  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add kippers and cook for 2 minutes per side, or until browned.",
    "Remove kippers from skillet and set aside.",
    "Add ginger, chili flakes, and salt to skillet and cook for 1 minute, or until fragrant.",
    "Add bean sprouts and cook for 2 minutes, or until tender.",
    "Add rice vinegar, fish sauce, and lime leaves to skillet and cook for 1 minute, or until heated through.",
    "Return kippers to skillet and stir to combine with dressing.",
    "Spoon kippers and dressing into mini cocottes and garnish with cilantro.",
    "Serve hot."
  ],
